  "description": "The Marley has become a classic: light, punchy and versatile. It might be your first bike to explore off-road, or the agile plaything of a seasoned rider. Using 6061 alloy tubing, the Marley balances a stiff frame with enough compliance for the longest of days in the saddle.\nThe Marley 1.0 takes all that’s great about the 2.0 but supercharges the spec: The addition of the group test winning Brand-X Ascend dropper. An upgraded 11-speed Deore groupset and SRAM DB8 brakes. Keeping things lively at the business end; a Marzocchi Z2 Rail provides additional stiffness with 130mm of exceptional damping.\nEverything you could want from an all-round hardtail; get wild straight out of the box.",
